\cf0 I'd specifically use 
\f1\b shadcn/ui rather than a traditional component library
\f0\b0 . Its components are actual code in your repository rather than a black-box dependency, which is particularly valuable for the reusable foundation you're building. It also supports semantic CSS-variable-based theming, which is exactly what you want for different companies.\
Better Auth is also a good fit because it already addresses email/password, social sign-in, account/session management, organizations, 2FA and related functionality, rather than forcing you to build authentication infrastructure yourself. Its API-key plugin also supports creating, managing and verifying API keys.\
