\f0\fs24 \cf0 when you need complete control.\
That is probably the most important design principle for the library you're describing:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 Build components as composable primitives with sensible defaults, not as rigid pre-built widgets.
